{"name":"Grauzone","hex":"#85a3b2","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Grauzone","blocks":[{"text":"Grauzone was a band from Bern, Switzerland, that was active and disbanded in the early 1980s. The band is most famous for their 1981 hit \"Eisbär\". The single charted at number 12 in Germany and number 6 in Austria. In addition to \"Eisbär\", they had some success with the singles \"Film 2\" and \"Wütendes Glas\"."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grauzone","wikidata":"Q672340"}],"images":[],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"Grey Bushchat in Sillery Gaon March 2025 by Tisha Mukherjee 01","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f9/Grey_Bushchat_in_Sillery_Gaon_March_2025_by_Tisha_Mukherjee_01.jpg/500px-Grey_Bushchat_in_Sillery_Gaon_March_2025_by_Tisha_Mukherjee_01.jpg","ratio":1.3997488488907492,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Grey_Bushchat_in_Sillery_Gaon_March_2025_by_Tisha_Mukherjee_01.jpg","share":0.418125},{"title":"Le Grau-du-Roi - Port - 04","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/Le_Grau-du-Roi_-_Port_-_04.jpg/500px-Le_Grau-du-Roi_-_Port_-_04.jpg","ratio":1.4986625055728935,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Le_Grau-du-Roi_-_Port_-_04.jpg","share":0.394375},{"title":"2006-01-14 Surface waves","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/43/2006-01-14_Surface_waves.jpg/500px-2006-01-14_Surface_waves.jpg","ratio":1.4545454545454546,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2006-01-14_Surface_waves.jpg","share":0.17875},{"title":"Madeira Grey Cat","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/Madeira_Grey_Cat.JPG/500px-Madeira_Grey_Cat.JPG","ratio":1.3333333333333333,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Madeira_Grey_Cat.JPG","share":0.174375},{"title":"Le Grau-du-Roi - Port - 05","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Le_Grau-du-Roi_-_Port_-_05.jpg/500px-Le_Grau-du